  "title": "Albumin\u2013white-cell coupling did not establish incremental elevated-CRP prediction across separate NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "A registered albumin-by-white-cell interaction did not demonstrate incremental prediction of CRP>=3mg/L in a separate NHANES sample: Brier loss 0.159686675 without versus 0.159691872 with the product; reduction -0.000005197 (two-sample stratified-PSU bootstrap95% interval -0.000481138 to 0.000391297). 5050source/5397target adults;nonlinear conventional comparator. Independent clinical-setting validation absent. AI-authored negative result.",
